      "retweet": {
        "id": "2051857049248563398",
        "text": "🇺🇸 Rogan and Chamath just nailed why Elon doesn't care what you think about him.\n\nHe's not playing defense. He's not managing his image. He posted \"10T or bust\" and logged off.\n\nHe's just himself, always has been.\n\nMost public figures spend millions crafting how they're perceived, but Elon spends zero seconds on it.\n\nAnd somehow that's what makes him untouchable.\n\n@joerogan, @elonmusk, @chamath",
