        "quoted": {
          "id": "2051795323605893230",
          "text": "🇺🇸 Joe Rogan just laid out exactly why \"just tax people more\" doesn't sit right with most Americans:\n\n\"If the federal government was forced to handle money the way a private company does, with everything out in the open, they would have gone bankrupt a long time ago. \n\nThey would have gone under. \n\nThe people managing that money would have all been put in jail.\"\n\nHis point lands harder when you connect it to what @DOGE had been exposing for months. \n\nInsane levels of fraud. \n\nNGOs sitting on enormous pools of taxpayer money. \n\nFunds being funneled through nonprofit middlemen into both Democratic and Republican coffers depending on who needs the favor. \n\nMoney that's supposed to help people somehow ending up everywhere except in the hands of the people it was meant to help.\n\nSource: @joerogan @chamath",
