      "text": "RT @tetsuoai: xAI and SpaceXAI have just made Colossus 1 available to Anthropic to support Claude.\n\nThis means more than 220,000 NVIDIA GPU…",
      "created_at": "Wed May 06 19:52:59 +0000 2026",
